Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:15.57,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If you want to make it \Ncome true, Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:20.49,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}kanaetai nara Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:28.17,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,ONE PIECE - LAND OF WANO ARC
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Setting out into the unknown world{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:40.06,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}mitakoto mo nai sekai mezashi{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Weathering rough wind and waves{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:45.23,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}araburu namikaze koete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.27,0:00:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I have to keep going because \NI want to get there first{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.27,0:00:49.94,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}tsukisusumanakya dame sa \Nichibannori shitain da{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Worry later since it's \Nall sink or swim anyway{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:56.20,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}shinpai toka atomawashi \Ndouse shoubu ichika bachika{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:01:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When your opponent looks daunting{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:01:02.74,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}aite ga dekaku mietara{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's a sign that your heart is shrinking{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:07.83,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}kokoro ga chijinderu shouko{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Running away is not a choice{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:10.38,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}nigeru nante choisu wa nai{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Take one step closer{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:12.50,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}ippo soba e chikadukun da{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Being called insolent's a compliment, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:14.97,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}namaiki tte homekotoba?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.01,0:01:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When things become tough, \Nthat's when you should laugh{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.01,0:01:19.34,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}kitsui toki hodo warattoke{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.89,0:01:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If you want to look for a new tomorrow{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.89,0:01:25.31,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}atarashii ashita sagashi ni ikitai no nara{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Polish your unique confidence{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:30.56,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}tobikkiri no jishin wo migaite{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Until your footsteps{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:35.11,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}tabi wo shita ashiato ga{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.15,0:01:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yes! Become a map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.15,0:01:38.78,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}sou! chizu ni kawaru made{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A new horizon, look, how far you've come{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:43.33,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}atarashii Horizon hora susunde kita bun{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's brighter and the \Nlevel of difficulty rises{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:48.37,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}mabushisa to nanido ga joushou{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Live in your dream and raise a hurricane{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:53.09,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}yumeutsutsu de okose Hurricane{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Now! Stir up the rankings{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:57.92,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}saa! chaato kakimidase{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:02:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:02:02.22,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dreams don't run away... Knock everything out{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:06.73,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}yume wa nigenai... zenbu Knock out{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.10,0:02:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.10,0:02:09.10,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Nin, nin, nin...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a ninja's true worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got the keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Having obtained the key to Luffy's cuffs,\NRaizo raced to meet him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Meanwhile, Luffy and Old Man Hyo\Nwho dodged the attack of the guards...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...were trying to break out of\Nthe Excavation Labor Camp.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You pieces of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Climb on my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:02:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw Hat Luffy is on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.42,0:03:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"Climb up!\NLuffy's Desperate Escape!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's impossible, straw hat man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.77,0:03:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll never know until you try!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You pieces of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Catch him already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.44,0:04:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Maybe, he can...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does he really think\Nhe can get out of here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, old man.\NWe fell quite far down...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, don't be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.65,0:05:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's not dead yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.55,0:05:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guys, get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Babanuki-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take care of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Elephant's Marchoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The key to your cuffs...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.16,0:06:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes, I think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make you understand\Nthat escape from Udon is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.74,0:07:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't get away from me this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave them to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.26,0:08:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Elephant's Marchoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn! I feel weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tsk. You gave us so much trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got something to tell you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:58.47,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,EBISU TOWN
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, don't worry at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can use the empty house all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're Zorojuro-{\i1}san{\i0}'s friends, feel free!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.44,0:09:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, you see,\Npeople are dying of hunger one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So there are a bunch of empty houses!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You really don't have to worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.37,0:09:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He laughs a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All you can do is laugh\Nwhen you're this hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, you just missed meeting Zorojuro-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.13,0:09:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.22,0:09:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, he suddenly rushed out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He said his sword got stolen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know how far he's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's highly likely that he got lost\Nand can't find the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As always...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.09,0:10:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, why isn't Blackleg-{\i1}ya{\i0} with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I haven't seen him for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The ability to become invisible...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.11,0:10:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I have to try it there...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,is there a bathhouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...he's already gone to...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.87,0:10:25.87,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,BATH
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.87,0:10:26.79,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,BATHHOUSE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:30.25,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,A BATHHOUSE, FLOWER CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so relaxing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So this is how a bath is in the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.19,0:10:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't it a little too hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we think it's cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...to endure it and say something like,\N"Today's bath is a bit too chilly, isn't it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't relate to that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:11:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Shinobu-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that low entrance way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's called a Pomegranate Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.84,0:11:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They put the wooden piece low so that\Nthe bath won't get too cool and the steam won't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.29,0:11:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see. Thank you for your explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, Orobi, do you get hot easily?\NDon't you wanna bathe in the hot water?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not comfortable soaking in a tub\Nin a public bathhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If anything happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.66,0:11:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're as cautious as a ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Magic users such as me and Orobi\Nget weaker when we soak in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But don't worry! No enemies will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The enemies aren't here but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at that. Should I charge them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.67,0:12:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...it's a mixed bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you familiar with \Na mixed bath like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that those men can't \Ntake their eyes off of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but it can't be helped!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.23,0:12:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Young men are all...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Hey, move!\N--Old woman, you're in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.25,0:12:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.41,0:12:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ninpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:35.96,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,NINPO
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ball-Crusher!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.67,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,BALL-CRUSHER
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's move on to the washing area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you get warmed up enough,\Nyou ask Sansuke to wash your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's Sansuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's Sansuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what we call the person\Nwho washes our backs at a bathhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why an octopus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, he has eight limbs.\NHe's suited to the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grab one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kyoshiro is scary.\NI don't know what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course you don't. He's a yakuza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're you talkin' about, you idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Land of Wano's yakuza are\Nsupposed to be the commoners' allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Young people may not know it,\Nbut there used to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:14:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...a great yakuza boss named\NHyogoro the Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that the person Kanjuro was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,20 years ago, the greatest yakuza boss\Nin the Land of Wano was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.35,0:14:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Hyogoro the Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's true.\NIf Boss Hyogoro the Flower were here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.49,0:14:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,he could've united the samurai at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To be honest, I don't think\Nwe can recruit 5,000 troops in a week like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe 500, at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.42,0:14:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm... Is he that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.84,0:14:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was the most influential man behind the scenes\Nin the Land of Wano 20 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and the great boss who had complete control\Nover the Flower Capital underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.97,0:14:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was also trusted by\Nthe bosses of the other five regions,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and nice even to commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.23,0:14:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was a real chivalrous yakuza\Nwho had both power and magnetism.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:15:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0} had respect for him, too,\Nsince he was young...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, if we can find him...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.29,0:15:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been over 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rumor has it that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.07,0:15:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...he refused to be subordinate to the Kurozumi Clan\Nand was killed by Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In contrast, Fukurokuju \Nwho leads the Oniwabanshu
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,that supported the Kozuki Clan \Nwith Boss Hyogoro the Flower...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...chose to serve Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I worked for him at that time,\Nbut I couldn't take it so I ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I became their enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Hanzo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're alive! You man-seducing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...sexy {\i1}kunoichi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.19,0:15:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why he knew you!\NShinobu-{\i1}chan{\i0}, you're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I kind of am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I miss him...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boss Hyogoro...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's become a part of history now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop making me repeat myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.47,0:16:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said if you join our pirate group,\NKaido-{\i1}san{\i0} will pardon you for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.83,0:16:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Talk about bad timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It brings back memories,\Ndoesn't it, Hyogoro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You were approached quite feverishly\Nby Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0} and Orochi back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The legendary yakuza became\Nsuch a malnourished old man,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and he will die a miserable death!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Did he say Hyogoro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! That small Old Man Hyo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.05,0:16:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care about myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but have mercy on this young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.11,0:17:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.69,0:17:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I got an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.33,0:17:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I came up with something exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I cannot believe it...\NYou really look exactly like you did back in those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is anyone there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is me, Raizo...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.63,0:17:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is Momonosuke-{\i1}sama{\i0} alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.26,0:17:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Kawamatsu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.11,0:17:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,K...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.14,0:17:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,K...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawamatsu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:17:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...really you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You are alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I am glad that I was able to put up with\Nall that rotten fish for 13 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me see your face, Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't. I am chained!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When will the fight be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nine days from now, on the \Nnight of the Fire Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chopping Kaido's head off\Nduring the festival to pay tribute to him is a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am sorry, Raizo,\Nbut could you get me out of here first?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I will! I will \Nget to it right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In order to set you free,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I need the key to the \Ncage and the key to the cuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I do not know if they will open\Nsince they are rusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's someone at the forbidden cell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Solitaire-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.05,0:18:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}We found the key thief\Nfrom the Executive Tower!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let him escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Smoke Escape Jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.77,0:19:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--He disappeared!\N--He must be a ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, leave the key thief to the others and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...bring the thing here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.77,0:19:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll execute the fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Come this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s Special Device Performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Sumo Inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Queen! Queen! Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sumo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This collar is the same as the ones\NI just put on you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.33,0:20:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Imagine this stone pillar is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.17,0:20:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave the ring with that thing on...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave the ring,\Nthe sharp blades will be ejected as you saw,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.27,0:21:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and your head will get cut off in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.85,0:21:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn! It's just like the \NCelestial Dragons' collar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, it's not designed to be taken off by force\Nso it's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.07,0:21:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't remove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.65,0:21:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be fine as long as you keep winning\Nsumo matches!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.62,0:21:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But stepping out of the \Nring means instant death!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.09,0:21:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys are a tag team!\NIf both of you fall out of the ring, the execution is complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if you ever change your mind\Nand wanna join our group,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.89,0:21:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,only Straw Hat will be released!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On this side, we'll use weapons,\Nfight in numbers, and have no collars!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.77,0:21:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll deploy as many people as we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.61,0:21:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I'll do you one favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.07,0:21:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll remove your Sea Prism Stone cuffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.69,0:22:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Whaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.04,0:22:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I went through a lot of trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.61,0:22:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, this is not the key \Nfor Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}'s cuffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.41,0:22:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.05,0:22:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a really nice person!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.13,0:22:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This means you're letting us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.09,0:22:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you forgetting about the collar?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I put something worse on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.47,0:22:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.93,0:22:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we fight as a tag team,\NI'll give Straw Hat-{\i1}san{\i0} trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.69,0:22:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you at least execute us separately?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.35,0:22:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Balloon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.57,0:22:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw Hat-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I kick your ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.16,0:22:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,will you let us out of here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.16,0:22:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.35,0:23:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The worst-ever deathmatch, the Sumo Inferno!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.07,0:23:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Its deadly rules force its unarmed \Nchallengers to fight Kaido's armed troops
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.03,0:23:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,who come attacking fiercely \Nfrom every direction!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.95,0:23:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}In this hellish situation,\NLuffy launches an offensive to survive!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.33,0:23:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Dead or Alive! Queen's Sumo Inferno!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.47,0:23:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.27,0:23:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.27,0:23:49.27,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
